==================================================

For this launch version, the intended progression is 15 lessons.

Do not claim that there are 30 lessons in the current launch version.

The 30-lesson concept corresponds to a larger future progression with 10 bosses.

For now:

15 lessons
5 bosses
3 lessons per boss

Future updates can expand this.

==================================================
11. FUTURE EXPANSION — DO NOT IMPLEMENT NOW
==================================================

The current launch version is intentionally limited.

Future major updates may add:

- more lessons
- more bosses
- more minions
- more gameplay
- deeper lore
- exploration of the city
- more explanation of the Oblivion Storm
- more explanation of why the crystals were stolen
- additional story/lore progression
