35. Confirm the settings/gear icon remains correctly positioned.
36. Confirm the full trial remains available.
37. Confirm the PC/web version still has the Lucky Wheel animation.

IMPORTANT:
Do not stop after changing the UI.

Verify the actual navigation, progression state, lesson data, locking/unlocking logic, and gameplay connections.

The biggest requirement is that this must function as an actual progression system:

LESSON → MINION → LESSON → MINION → LESSON → MINION → BOSS

repeated for five boss chapters, giving:

15 LESSONS
15 MINIONS
5 BOSSES

with the four existing gameplay modes available at the appropriate minion encounters, while the Tetris-like fourth mode remains premium/locked for free players.

